OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Lib Dem leader says party
OL,4,Ashould be more exciting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh Liberal Democrats leader has
OL,7,Fcalled for her party to be "more
OL,8,Fexciting".
OL,10,FSpeaking at the party's annual
OL,11,Fconference in Brighton, Jane Dodds said
OL,12,Fshe was disappointed to be the only
OL,13,FLiberal Democrat elected at May's
OL,14,FSenedd elections and questioned the
OL,15,Fparty's messaging on independence.
OL,17,FDodds said she was "sorry" that Wales
OL,18,Fdid not vote for more of her
OL,19,Fcolleagues, and that it was important
OL,20,Fto ask why.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
