OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh Lib Dem leader says party
OL,4,Ashould be more exciting
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe also called for the introduction of
OL,7,Fan AI wealth tax and for more to be
OL,8,Fdone to tackle climate change,
OL,9,Fsuggesting people consider "flying
OL,10,Fless".
